e delivery via the cloud","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Palantir 與 Knox 簽署協議以促進透過雲端的軟體交付，成為人們關注的焦點"},{"title":"Palantir Rises 5% on Knox Partnership for Federal Cloud Software; Leidos Edges Higher, Booz Allen Hamilton Slips","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"諾克斯與聯邦雲端軟體合作，Palantir 股價上漲 5%； Leidos 走高，Booz Allen Hamilton 下滑"},{"title":"Palantir's TITAN contract signals shift to operational AI in defense, boosting recurring cash flow despite high valuation.","src":"Pluang","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPN19Lc0h0S0lRR0x1aTJsTU82dzg3ell0Mks4d2lQX3BUNlVOb0VLZUUzYXRmQ1RRM1huYW5Rc0hodFFWc0s2Yk1EYjJ2LUZDS1pwMFFycV80eWlyZnBhekdLQUpvdDRmRC1YdnZ4ZTRUakN0LVV1eUpIdVR4ZXZxaGxidFFzSjBZRzUyaEVJWWE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Palantir 的 TITAN 合約標誌著國防領域向營運型人工智慧的轉變，儘管估值很高，但仍增加了經常性現金流。"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1321655/000132165526000011/pltr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We were founded in 2003 and started building software for the intelligence community in the United States to assist in counterterrorism investigations and operations. We later began working with commercial enterprises, who often faced fundamentally similar challenges in working with data.","zh":null},{"en":"We have built four principal software platforms, Palantir Gotham (\"Gotham\"), Palantir Foundry (\"Foundry\"), Palantir Apollo (\"Apollo\"), and our Artificial Intelligence Platform (\"AIP\"). Foundry is our foundational data operations platform, which provides the core capabilities for data management, logic authoring, systemic mapping development through Palantir Ontology (\"Ontology\"), analytics, and workflow development. AIP is our generative artificial intelligence (\"AI\") platform, which provides secure connectivity to third-party-provided large language models (\"LLMs\"), a development toolchain for building AI-powered agents and automations, an array of AI-enabled end user applications, a broad evaluations framework for governing AI workflows in production, and more. Apollo is our continuous delivery platform, enabling the orchestration of upgrades of services and assets every day to manage ","zh":null},{"en":"integrates with our other platforms, as well as our broader defense offerings, to power a wide array of missions across allied defense and intelligence operations.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We work with many of the world's leading government and commercial institutions. As of December 31, 2025, we had 954 customers.","zh":null},{"en":"Our software is used across many industries around the world. It is applied to a variety of use cases by users across various business functions and levels of organizations, including by utility operations analysts, automotive manufacturing workers, oil and gas technicians and operators, and pharmaceutical researchers in the United States; supply-chain managers in South Korea; public health administrators in the United Kingdom and the United States; and special forces personnel and military officials in the United States and abroad.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"Organizations frequently attempt to build their own data platforms before turning to buy ours. In trying to build something on their own, they generally rely on a patchwork of custom solutions, outside consultants, IT services companies, packaged enterprise and open source software, and significant internal IT resources.","zh":null},{"en":"In addition, our competitors include large enterprise software companies, government contractors, and system integrators. We also face competition from emerging companies as well as established companies that have entered, and may continue to enter, this market.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Government Operating","val":2402287000,"zh":"Government Operating"},{"name":"Commercial","val":2073159000,"zh":"Commercial"}],"total":4475446000}},"peers":["AMD","AVGO","TSM","MU","SOFI"]}}